# The Gradle wrapper is committed on purpose: CI runs `gradlew` directly and
# Flutter only regenerates the wrapper as a side effect of a full build, which
# needs the licensed Cubism/QNN SDKs. Keeping the jar and the launch scripts in
# version control makes `:app:testDebugUnitTest` reproducible on a bare runner.
!gradle-wrapper.jar
!gradlew
!gradlew.bat
/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
